      en: ["Founded by the Verona Fathers in the year 1901.", "Located on the west bank of the White Nile north of Malakal.", "Established as the first Catholic station in the Shilluk territory.", "Introduced the region's first formal schooling in the early 1900s.", "Significant hub for medical services during the colonial period.", "Subject to multiple evacuations during the Second Sudanese Civil War."],
