      en: ["Northernmost point of the historic Shilluk Kingdom's territory.", "Significant river port for the trade of grain and livestock.", "Site of 19th-century battles between the Shilluk and Khartoum traders.", "Strategic military post during the Mahdist Revolt in the 1880s.", "Located on the west bank of the White Nile in Manyo region.", "Critical logistical supply hub for the northern South Sudan."],
